# [[.Name]]

A [giode](https://github.com/mehran9675/giode) app.

```sh
giode run              # run on this computer
giode run android      # build, install and run on a connected Android device
giode build android    # dist/android/[[.Binary]].apk
giode build windows    # dist/windows/[[.Binary]].exe
giode build web        # dist/web
giode doctor           # check the toolchains
```

App settings - name, ID, version, icon, permissions - are in `giode.toml`.
